1baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昔年同社为秋词，今成往事，离居多感，岁晏不聊，触绪生吟，冰霜满月，凛尖风之透骨，感皎月之映心，多因梦后之思，添出酒边之句，聊作秋声貂续，以为春咏前驱，合曰寒词得一十六首 其十五","author":"王彦泓","text":"弱质何曾避晓风，清霜留下去时踪。\n个人真与梅花似，一日幽香冷处秾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昔年同社为秋词，今成往事，离居多感，岁晏不聊，触绪生吟，冰霜满月，凛尖风之透骨，感皎月之映心，多因梦后之思，添出酒边之句，聊作秋声貂续，以为春咏前驱，合曰寒词得一十六首 其十六","author":"王彦泓","text":"罗巾书满岁寒词，小字红钤付所知。\n冰雪心肠冰雪貌，年年相对插梅时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从改第六首","author":"王彦泓","text":"玉腻绵香细骨躯，暖相偎处恰愁吁。\n娇痴怕对春风换，不似寒宵酷念奴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲事杂题 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"闲翻绣谱与睡相，深缬葡萄浅瑞香。\n阿母惯嗔交颈鸟，只描双蝶过秋棠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲事杂题 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"水沉重彻藕丝衫，明映蝤蛴碧玉缄。\n行出画阑风日好，髻丛花片蝶飞衔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲事杂题 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"掠鬓初齐侧眼看，红棉新拭镜光寒。\n斜回雪颈些些见，贝齿畏痕恰恼欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲事杂题 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"拾得残笺有几行，瘦斜书势似萧郎。\n莫教漏泄关心事，贮向裙前瑟瑟囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲事杂题 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"爱染朱丝约髻心，退红嫌浅绛嫌深。\n通犀插久销光彩，更遣寻求蜜蜡金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲事杂题 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"莫愁擎著凤凰雏，秀发明眸粉玉搓。\n低笑唤卿亲切看，阿侯姿貌似谁多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲事杂题 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"偶向灯前制锦鞋，半窗梅影下瑶阶。\n良宵不厌熏香坐，为听萧郎读紫钗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲事杂题 其八","author":"王彦泓","text":"丰神宜笑韵宜嗔，随意梳头态更真。\n流品自知应第一，不劳寻见尹夫人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人招集不赴","author":"王彦泓","text":"为感蘼芜曲，无心赋锦鞋。\n怜香留故枕，祝梦掩空斋。\n酒畔红酥手，缨边翠羽钗。\n暂堪同一醉，幽恨几时排。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29903,"s