":"王彦泓","text":"帘外晴阴几遍探，侍儿犹恐意难堪。\n虽然残雪消还有，且喜今朝尚十三。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29928,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孝仪看灯词十二首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"灯街试走断红颦，新嫁桥南第几晨。\n夫婿却扶佯不要，一回低媚一回嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29929,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孝仪看灯词十二首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"青油车子过斜阳，风飏湘帘出画裳。\n曾在石家筵上见，是谁香气试猜详。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29930,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孝仪看灯词十二首 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"步向庭梅绕几巡，莫愁家月倍堪珍。\n何须更看花灯去，若个灯人似个人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29931,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孝仪看灯词十二首 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"欲换明妆自忖量，莫教难认暗衣裳。\n忽然省得钟情句，不辨花丛却辨香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29932,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孝仪看灯词十二首 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"小玉飞琼动静俱，几回当面笑愁吁。\n眼波第一防他觉，不审狂郎解得无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29933,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孝仪看灯词十二首 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"暗风相约宋墙东，一寸灵心两处同。