:"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题上元竹枝词 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"风雨元宵意倍伤，画檐低拜扫晴娘。\n若教扫得天边雨，为扫离人泪两行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题上元竹枝词 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"腰身十七正娇慵，珠凤鞋帮一捻红。\n不奈小桥春露滑，阿娘扶过石栏东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题上元竹枝词 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"瓦坼龟文一例看，断连横竖有悲欢。\n一声脆响笼灯看，暂作排愁事一端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题上元竹枝词 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"白縠单衫绝点埃，经年皎洁似初裁。\n何须更取园蔬识，偶趁同袍一摘来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂题上元竹枝词 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"夜筵花果绕香炉，心事年年问紫姑。\n灯后踏青挑菜起，不知堪会那人无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妇病忧绝 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"药饵无征怪梦频，漫将牲玉祷明神。\n巉岩骨出难眠坐，细碎心烦易喜嗔。\n争奈睡眸开彻夜，可堪肝病苦逢春。\n繁华白日重门掩，绕榻啼痕满六亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妇病忧绝 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"臂颤难擎漱一杯，羸形扶起望庭梅。\n花当病眼偏生好，雨趁伤心特地催。\n口味断来单剩药，愿香酬罢更无财。\n穷途无计堪娱汝，聊折瓶花一两栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呈外父时妇病方苦","author":"王彦泓","text":"王郎才地本凡庸，爱女怜才感谢公。\n羯末许陪狂烂漫，云英教捧醉朦胧。\n肯令痴恚随中妇，喜见娇雏似外翁。\n共绕病人连夜坐，最伤心处此心同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述妇病怀 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"琉璃调药自看煎，尽日松涛小榻边。\n慵唤侍儿凭响板，鹦哥传出翠帘前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述妇病怀 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"闷拈叶子强寻欢，自觉双银约指宽。\n阿母无聊听卜命，脱将跳脱觅人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述妇病怀 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"消渴还愁骨亦消，玩冰衔玉总无憀。\n春来泼尽如泉泪，病肺除非引泪浇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]